<title>ESTONIA: AVERAGE INTERBANK RATES UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>AVERAGE INTERBANK RATES UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average interbank rates in</p>
<p>Estonia were unchanged on Wednesday, the country's central bank</p>
<p>said. </p>
<p>&quot;Nothing is going on in the market, everybody is waiting</p>
<p>for something and relying on themselves,&quot; an analyst said.</p>
<p>He added that a fall in one-week rates, which rose sharply</p>
<p>up last week, was expected soon.</p>
<p>  TALIBOR/TALIBID   1-Week	1-Month    3-Month</p>
<p>  May 21	     5.43/4.43  6.00/5.00  7.35/6.35</p>
<p>  May 14	     5.43/4.43  6.00/5.00  7.35/6.35</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
